                                                                                                                        
  Keys   Legend   Rating   Data   Limitations                                                                           
                                                                                                                        
  sumo-api.com  History, profiles and statistics since 1960, run by a volunteer. basho keeps to its request for         
                responsible use: at most one request per second, and finished tournaments ship inside basho.            
  osada.us      Live results of the current tournament, scraped from the Japan Sumo Association's official pages and    
                run by one person on a best-effort basis. Its usage policy allows search and AI input, not AI           
                training; basho shows the source and time of its data.                                                  
                                                                                                                        
  The embedded snapshot of finished tournaments is built from sumo-api.com. Ratings are basho's own Elo-style estimate  
  from past results, not an official ranking and not betting advice.                                                    
                                                                                                                        
  The status bar names the source of what is on screen and when it was fetched.                                         
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
